":3,"description_zh":"15-64","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"age","description_en":""},{"seq":3,"name_zh":"教育程度","name_en":"Q2","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 小學以下 2 國(初)中、職 3 高中、職 4 專科 5 大學 6 研究所以上","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"education level","description_en":""},{"seq":4,"name_zh":"婚姻狀況","name_en":"Q3","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 未婚 2 有配偶或同居 3 離婚或分居 4 喪偶","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"marital status","description_en":""},{"seq":5,"name_zh":"宗教信仰","name_en":"Q4","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 道教 2 佛教 3 基督教 4 天主教 5 其他 6 無宗教信仰","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":6,"name_zh":"政黨參與二、工作狀況","name_en":"Q5","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 有加入政黨 2 沒有加入政黨","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":7,"name_zh":"沒有從事有收入工作之 原因","name_en":"Q6_N","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 照顧家人 2 料理家事 3 退休 4 在學或進修中 5 找工作中 6 幫忙家庭事業 7 其他","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":8,"name_zh":"從事有收入工作之行業","name_en":"Q6_Y","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 農、林、漁、牧 2 工、礦 3 商 4 服務 5 公教、軍、警","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":9,"name_zh":"從業身分","name_en":"Q6_1","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 雇主 2 自營作業者 3 受政府雇用者 4 受私人雇用者","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":10,"name_zh":"每月平均收入","name_en":"Q6_2","type":"Char","length":2,"description_zh":"1 20,000元以下 2 20,000-29,999元 3 30,000-39,999元 4 40,000-49,999元 5 50,000-59,999元 6 60,000-69,999元 7 70,000-79,999元 8 80,000-89,999元 9 90,000-99,999元 10 100,000元以上 88 不知道","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":11,"name_zh":"從事目前工作主要原因","name_en":"Q6_3","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1 適合自己興趣或專長 2 經濟需要 3 不想受家庭束縛 4 有成就感 5 其他 8 不知道/無意見","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":12,"name_zh":"目前工作環境中是否有 下列困擾_性別歧視","name_en":"Q6_4_1","type":"Char","length":1,"descriptio